  "mach:judgement": "Adopt",
  "mach:judgementReason": "The most comprehensive open biomedical MCP server available — Apache-2.0, 1.4k stars, v1.2.1 (May 2026), Harvard Zitnik Lab governance. Exposes 211 curated biomedical tools (openFDA, Open Targets, protein docking, PubMed, pharmacovigilance) as MCP endpoints, enabling any MCP-compatible agent to call clinical-grade biomedical infrastructure directly. MCP Tasks support for long-running async operations is production-ready. This is the plumbing layer for clinical AI agents — not a demo, but connective infrastructure with real scientific depth behind each tool.",
  "mach:editorialReviewedAt": "2026-05-24",
